;__koi__ (BAI): Bounded by. Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of korbi.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of korbi and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is bounded by (bordered by) the referent of the tagged sumti. See also:
** Keywords:

