!! Proposed Definition of ''de'i''

;__de'i__ (BAI): Dated. Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of detri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 1st place of detri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi takes place at the date that is the referent of the tagged sumti. This may be used to date letters. See also:
** Keywords: dated. at date.

!! Examples of ''de'i'' Usage
''u'i mi viska lo skami ctuca skina pe de'i li 1995''
Heh. I'm watching a computer tutorial movie from 1995.

''doi camgusmis do di'a se jibri de'i ma''
Robin, when do you start working again?

