;__ve de'i__ (BAI*): On date by calendar. Tags a sumti as fitting the 4th place of detri.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra, un-numbered place with the meaning of the 4th place of detri and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi takes place on a date according to the calendar which is the referent of the tagged sumti. See also:
